    skos:definition '''{"node": {
    "decommissioned": "1986-02-10",
    "platformclass": "vessel of opportunity",
    "notes": "Ro/ro vessel built 1978 as Atlantic Project (UK). Re-registered in Malta 28 Feb 1981 and renamed Merzario Hispania and renamed Stena Hispania 18 Nov 1983. Re-registered in the UK again and renamed Kotka Violet 2 Dec 1984, then reverted to Stena Hispania 24 Jan 1985.  Renamed Stena Britannica 12 Feb 1986.  Subsequently re-registered and renamed. As at Sep 2006 she is active as the Swedish registered vessel Finnforest.",
